    {
      "id": "ede4a66c-ba0d-453a-9a77-6dc954b70b70",
      "title": "Leia a explicação curta e note o pedaço que fica estável.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "49b2a879-eee0-4e33-b80e-9ed587d5e070",
          "textContent": "<p>Com cabelo e olhos, o espanhol costuma usar <strong>tener</strong>.</p><p>Por isso aparecem moldes como <strong>tener el pelo ...</strong> e <strong>tener los ojos ...</strong>.</p><p>Nesta aula, o foco é perceber a forma do verbo: <strong>tengo</strong>, <strong>tienes</strong> e <strong>tiene</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b42834fc-66cf-49d5-83a6-4ed068d14273",
      "title": "Escute os cartões e observe que só muda o final da frase.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "bd3b8708-7aec-42de-bd3f-7ddbda848587",
          "textContent": "<p>Exemplo 1</p><p><strong>Tengo los ojos verdes.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Tenho os olhos verdes.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/6de0e90bc4ad4113ae6c4f98bfbdd11d_b03-tengo-los-ojos-verdes.mp3?Expires=1794099412&Signature=MvOeUJh~5MxlBKjkTxrO9FtDi6-BayyWr-O0X1XqVhtyDymuIhvnVP77TFPR9MFHdAUeGSIQqaAenpg3tKR9Z3udi0C4spra~T2BHeA1p--eRp~FmItPq5EcKFRXS3GSyLgLnNTpMBp5FBjCsUJ2I0rMqbUFgNTs3VHv6KeAT02gYfpuIwJeMruZzrRUcxrI4GbdwKTlrWbs3222xsn~WtYz9WFU-vKRfRRLQFexl3iuJF9xxAKThAkRVrEjpcyIeeLMie-uS5U5Gr3Ii2pBBLlp~Y8UbWxLi3rsiDduPjz04i3XOTA~tN0-YGp6X5su7aak4D2Xjkbz9IJs-qY8Tg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "495592b3-0917-4550-8ad3-a489dca652c4",
          "textContent": "<p>Exemplo 2</p><p><strong>Tengo una hermana.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Tenho uma irmã.</strong></p>",
