    {
      "id": "8b4fd2c2-ae52-49b7-8759-aa737938fe60",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a pergunta e note a forma usada quando eu falo com você.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "c6637ca1-ad98-4914-b891-946298694a27",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora a frase vai para a outra pessoa.</p><p><strong>¿Tienes hermanos?</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Você tem irmãos?</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/61efc1e64a5c4072bab11b0ffba2aee2_b04-tienes-hermanos-scene.png?Expires=1794099412&Signature=tclmW16t-dc8gNR1gNOzqZ2zAX5rW7NMCvPJXVWTdZmgw28vWZjETQSQBhfFAsEHaYJj1AUPyCclDOxBkiL49EgfiymBR-SFLoirezgU7eQaqCe8n-Jm35wfsEK5pGzvXYV3PoscRq3V-DzOTb9w8mZOXxk2-CpbwAMkmLVETM~p5IwU7IArDAPHaimDDrTPr-L7sXmleVGDTw23JvjZCUZVBNLSrIAnUZ3fTAd~V5zN2Sq~3euWfzlIlYtKf59pVM5HHT~7v1dsFovgZB4GB8HOu9MoKShf9eN--qE11A7k9aZOElgzlJiI4FYE2b1wSo8RB6KJBrkWlUGMCstX9w__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
