    {
      "id": "b3c38267-98bb-43bc-8daa-e4af4e1ec26d",
      "title": "Leia a explicação curta e pense em quem está no foco da frase.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 7,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "cc1d154e-6120-4701-adb5-de7cfafa8faf",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>tiene</strong> aparece quando a frase fala de <strong>él</strong>, <strong>ella</strong> ou de um nome.</p><p>Você pode pensar em moldes como <strong>Elena tiene ...</strong>, <strong>ella tiene ...</strong> ou <strong>mi padre tiene ...</strong></p><p>O foco não é quem escuta nem quem fala, mas <strong>outra pessoa</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "78263a75-c50b-409d-977f-0693e9466054",
      "title": "Escute cada linha e observe quem está no foco: eu, você ou outra pessoa.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 8,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "989147af-6eed-4de9-b586-3dbc5b4eb23b",
          "textContent": "<p>Fala de <strong>mim</strong>.</p><p><strong>Tengo una hermana.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Tenho uma irmã.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/f71584f4cf49475cb2ed6a5eef2ca39e_b03-tengo-una-hermana.mp3?Expires=1794099412&Signature=WViVLUVitYBl34XnqrRogsRhPsLd4FCzRfdTXXU6eSSjgZ7lTU93YK8Wq3HmN2UkMzPNjTbBDQJ6uT~0RKAOm-FVf5P78EgKyO6iFGUQ6QcINYM7xC8DqOd12Z72kJ9tYC~qOvNDX601biqKt7jimQCpGI9wCNSeKkRTKJppI2tm~lVZkkLUOnYFQf-IVZyVWD4XISVPKyZzovo~~LmnaTY4ezkrRfZKmrezobC9AdnNTt5DcysvQfIyXTspNGF~0jA5wmS9r9sSRY5h4QY0NqCf7UW9U2de-Avycvg7Kzcwi6zXAbMYPdByK5S8dKy8P20jY4OYMhFESSoBV2M3Wg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "36fea66e-db6a-4576-b55c-85a39eea4e3f",
          "textContent": "<p>Fala com <strong>você</strong>.</p><p><strong>¿Tienes hermanos?</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Você tem irmãos?</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/4fc11aa4c8254621a6c680fdfbcaf927_b04-tienes-hermanos.mp3?Expires=1794099412&Signature=TN4sYhbRKyTfF6xpI8U4gjd2P0C812kYxAxH0coUhfMtdhOixJn~QiplI9YzVxPupcOLRd0dTMuqzbdZxHEi6LxAP2R145OnUNoojPRk~Ak-i5hikBVnr1SsgNZ6m58RwP~8bqYOUms9eCKy0fm0SYqSpgyoHcbxUIn3BCmOAcWieJYW9zCcnfsK7lvx8sZ7f5clB3OkEGgN~zTbzO~FcIjF2vKCef9W9G3lzn9~IiDKb5KVWS3H-RC870PAY~aer590S2eTy3upU1CEOHXn8fCgQXeFTbG5nOuezQgz~8cNYMjbgHUcuTiq1GqytnyBEaIPKB6ZQXwaFmh9izdiww__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "a6605a74-404f-4eed-995e-96da9204ff95",
          "textContent": "<p>Fala de <strong>outra pessoa</strong>.</p><p><strong>Elena tiene dos libros.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Elena tem dois livros.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/552a37956516496ca08b14a0f4a6686f_b06-elena-tiene-dos-libros.mp3?Expires=1794099412&Signature=FJK26gVjgDty5rOlTXGAfJXqsUFFJ1mA48WW1Bww8~PNtCUcLsRMUP74CkROOsJQkdZn3slnHLmE4RODDX7qmbz2JantO9mFbEOfhD8mYpwo9lBN5M8SjVXmpwy0hR6iO1GGTSRh9JNVBtRI5kTLGbhD6SM2kIiNEKkC1N2hg4i~Deworm~SZmO08ZNpKAtlYSLOrCjANOlmxujxysBgmeiHfY3-FhcbkVLw4aFOjxSzuxXgffGHxBuXOQYH9wGisrxz15GL26Yf1M-tMBwxRHKuEdVHcGP1ZfM4dAfppjRGK6FYuC627CvxSQjx70Q36su8DB6xcytVwvobX~mZgw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
